  "description": "Baek Juho has been haunted ever since he was a child, when he answered a ghost’s question and lost his family for it. For a short time back then, he shared his childhood with a boy named Cha Juyul, until a death tore them apart and left Juho with a deep-rooted guilt and longing he has carried ever since. \n\nYears later, the two meet again on campus. But Juyul greets him like any other freshman, asking for his name as if they’ve never met. \n\n…Has Juyul truly forgotten him? Or is there a reason he wants Juho to believe he has? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
